:: d6 [map littlemoose]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->d6: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Visit the Mergimal Challenge Vending Machine.->d6: vending machine]]</li>
      <li>[[Talk to the dude standing there.->d6: rando]]</li>
      <li>[[Check out Veil School->d6: veil school]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'd6'>><<n>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'd6'>>
</div>

:: d6: description
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <img class='concept' src='images/story/littlemoose.png'>
  <div>
    <p>Littlemoose is a sleepy town, nestled in a tall forest. It is the home of the Veil School and its leader, Grace.</p>
    <p>The path to the north leads out of the town and into Littlemoose forest. A dirt path to the west is blocked by a heavy iron gate.</p>
    <p>A Mergimal Challenge Vending machine is here, where you can spend your hard-earned challenge coins.</p>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Keep exploring the village.->$currentLocation]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

:: d6: vending machine [vend littlemoose]
<<include 'vending machine'>>
[[Look around Littlemoose.->$currentLocation]]

:: d6: veil school
<<if $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.closed == false>>\
    The school is closed?!?

    Oh dear.

    GAIN keyword CLOSED.<<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.closed = true>><<redo 'keywords'>>

    [[Continue exploring.->$currentLocation]]
<<else>>\
    (Keyword CLOSED detected)

    The school is dark. No one seems to be here.

    [[Continue exploring.->$currentLocation]]
<</if>>